# Razorpay Plan IDs — fill-in template
#
# Copy this OUT of the repo (the repo root is cloud-synced — see secrets/README.md),
# once per environment, and fill in the IDs from the Razorpay dashboard:
#
#   cp secrets/plan-ids.template ~/secrets/infographicai/plan-ids.staging.env
#   cp secrets/plan-ids.template ~/secrets/infographicai/plan-ids.production.env
#
# Plan IDs are PER-ENVIRONMENT and mode-specific:
#   staging     -> Plan objects created in the dashboard's TEST mode
#   production  -> Plan objects created in the dashboard's LIVE mode
# These are different objects. The same ID cannot serve both.
#
# Dashboard naming convention:  BG-<TIER>-<INTERVAL>-<YYYY>-<MM>
#
# STATUS
#   TEST mode  -> done 2026-08-27 as BG-<TIER>-<INTERVAL>-2026-08, all 8 verified.
#                 See ~/secrets/infographicai/plan-ids.staging.env.
#   LIVE mode  -> not created yet. NOTE: `2026-08` is already taken in live mode by
#                 eight abandoned 100x-price plans (see below), so the live set needs a
#                 DIFFERENT generation token — the month you create them, or a -v2 suffix.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BEFORE YOU CREATE THE PLANS: the amount field takes RUPEES, not paise.
# Enter the "Amount (Rs)" column below verbatim. Plans are price-immutable and
# cannot be deleted — a wrong amount means abandoning the object and recreating.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
#   Plan name                    Period    Amount (Rs)   -> key below
#   BG-SOLO-MONTHLY-<YYYY-MM>    monthly         5,499   RAZORPAY_PLAN_SOLO_MONTHLY
#   BG-SOLO-ANNUAL-<YYYY-MM>     yearly         52,999   RAZORPAY_PLAN_SOLO_ANNUAL
#   BG-PRO-MONTHLY-<YYYY-MM>     monthly        10,999   RAZORPAY_PLAN_PRO_MONTHLY
#   BG-PRO-ANNUAL-<YYYY-MM>      yearly       1,05,999   RAZORPAY_PLAN_PRO_ANNUAL
#   BG-TEAM-MONTHLY-<YYYY-MM>    monthly        21,999   RAZORPAY_PLAN_TEAM_MONTHLY
#   BG-TEAM-ANNUAL-<YYYY-MM>     yearly       2,10,999   RAZORPAY_PLAN_TEAM_ANNUAL
#   BG-AGENCY-MONTHLY-<YYYY-MM>  monthly        43,999   RAZORPAY_PLAN_AGENCY_MONTHLY
#   BG-AGENCY-ANNUAL-<YYYY-MM>   yearly       4,21,999   RAZORPAY_PLAN_AGENCY_ANNUAL
#
# Descriptions (shown on invoices — match the pricing page's wording):
#   Solo   — 50 AI marketing designs/month, 1 user. Billed monthly. / Billed annually.
#   Pro    — 100 AI marketing designs/month, 1 user. Billed monthly. / Billed annually.
#   Team   — 200 AI marketing designs/month, 5 users. Billed monthly. / Billed annually.
#   Agency — 400 AI marketing designs/month, unlimited users. Billed monthly. / Billed annually.
#
# Amounts and quotas above mirror PLAN_CONFIG in shared/schema.ts, which is canonical.
# Interval = 1 and Currency = INR for all eight. The quota stays MONTHLY on annual plans;
# only the billing is yearly. Ignore the dashboard's USD option — INR only, see
# docs/agile/PRD/2026-08-26-international-billing.md.
#
# Then:
#   node scripts/verify-razorpay-plan-prices.mjs ~/secrets/infographicai/plan-ids.staging.env
#   DRY_RUN=1 bash scripts/set-razorpay-plan-ids.sh ~/secrets/.../plan-ids.staging.env staging
#   bash scripts/set-razorpay-plan-ids.sh ~/secrets/.../plan-ids.staging.env staging
#
# The verify step needs RAZORPAY_KEY_ID + RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET for the matching mode —
# either add them to this file or have them in your shell environment.

RAZORPAY_PLAN_SOLO_MONTHLY=plan_...
RAZORPAY_PLAN_SOLO_ANNUAL=plan_...
RAZORPAY_PLAN_PRO_MONTHLY=plan_...
RAZORPAY_PLAN_PRO_ANNUAL=plan_...
RAZORPAY_PLAN_TEAM_MONTHLY=plan_...
RAZORPAY_PLAN_TEAM_ANNUAL=plan_...
RAZORPAY_PLAN_AGENCY_MONTHLY=plan_...
RAZORPAY_PLAN_AGENCY_ANNUAL=plan_...

# Needed only by verify-razorpay-plan-prices.mjs; safe to omit if already in your shell.
# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
